			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fix incorrect argument in IconContainer#createIcon by @senseiwells in https://github.com/Patbox/map-canvas-api/pull/4\n* Implement `DrawableCanvas.fill` by @senseiwells in https://github.com/Patbox/map-canvas-api/pull/5\n* Added support for Unifont. While it isn't bundled by default, it will be downloaded and parsed from Mojang servers when used/requested. After first usage, it will be cached in Map Canvas API's Font format for quicker loading.\n\n## New Contributors\n* @senseiwells made their first contribution in https://github.com/Patbox/map-canvas-api/pull/4\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Patbox/map-canvas-api/compare/0.4.1+1.21...0.4.2+1.21.1"
